MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "That's Christmas To Me feels like a natural next choice because Christmas albums recur throughout my listening history.",
    "PTXmas also connects clearly with my holiday listening; passing on it today reflects my preference to choose just one album, not a lack of interest."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "21 Number Ones, 50 Number Ones, and The Very Best of Neil Diamond offer broad hits collections when I am looking for a more specific holiday listening experience.",
    "Stages does not fit what I want this visit, while titles such as Pain Killer and Lead With Your Heart give me too little connection to my interests to motivate a choice."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat my interest in a few albums as a reason to offer music broadly, even when the holiday connection is missing.",
    "Several selections seem to assume that a collection of familiar hits would appeal to me, although my recent choices do not show that preference."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated Christmas album choices, including returning to The Classic Christmas Album, matter more to this visit than a loose connection through music alone.",
    "I rarely choose something without a clear reason to expect it will fit; an unfamiliar title alone is not enough to draw me away from the holiday albums."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The Christmas recommendations understood my strongest interest, but most other selections stretched that interest into a broader appetite for music than I feel today."
}
